A||||2||Bill||How do you set timing on 86 se v6 ??
Z||000000||Bill||05-31-99||03:48 PM||||would like to know how to set timing on 86 v6. do you unplug the 4 wire lead from the module ? or do you leave that plugged in and put jumper wire in th ecm a&b terminal ? or is there something else you do??<br>thanks
Z||000001||Hock||06-02-99||07:51 AM||||the way to set the timing on you fiero is to jump the A&B terminals on the ALDL connector. unless you have a performance chip DO NOT take the timing past the factory specs or you will have all kinds of problems. all of this is from my own experience, so have fun.
